<item>
            <title>[JGVT-4463] Reports_Audit Trail: Experiment Audit Trail - User Interface - Custom Search Builder</title>
                <link>https://jira.jnj.com/browse/JGVT-4463</link>
                <project id="46901" key="JGVT">TDS - Revvity Signals ELN</project>
                    <description><![CDATA[<p><b>As a user,</b></p>

<p>I want to build advanced queries using multiple conditions on the Experiment Audit Trail, so that I can review specific GxP audit records efficiently.</p>

<p>The Custom Search Builder shall allow the user to select an audit trail field, choose a comparison operator, enter a value, and combine multiple conditions using AND or OR logic. The resulting query shall be applied to the Experiment Audit Trail table.</p>

<h1>Scope</h1>
<ul class="alternate" type="square">
    <li>Provide access to the Custom Search Builder from the Experiment Audit Trail page.</li>
    <li>Allow the user to create, edit and remove multiple search conditions.</li>
    <li>Support AND and OR combinations between conditions.</li>
    <li>Support searches on the available Experiment Audit Trail fields.</li>
    <li>Apply the query and display only matching audit trail records.</li>
    <li>Allow the user to clear the query and return to the unfiltered results.</li>
    <li>Inform the user when no records match the query.</li>
</ul>

<h1>Out of scope</h1>
<ul class="alternate" type="square">
    <li>Export functionality, which is covered by JGVT-4462.</li>
    <li>Changes to the audit trail data source.</li>
    <li>Changes to existing sorting, pagination or basic search behavior.</li>
</ul>]]></description>
